# Backend Standards (NestJS + TypeORM)

- Follow NestJS module/service/controller patterns and keep logic layered.
- Use TypeORM entities and DTOs with explicit, strongly typed contracts.
- Prefer clean, scalable patterns aligned with SOLID and DRY principles.

# RBAC and Security

- Enforce role-based access with the custom `@Permissions` decorator.
- Protect permissioned routes with `PermissionsGuard`.
- Keep authenticated request and JWT payload interfaces explicit and minimal.

# Local Development Seeding

- Keep seeding logic idempotent so reruns do not duplicate data.
- Use deterministic role/user bootstrap behavior for consistent local setups.
